(text "Negative rail uses ground-referenced inverter, NOT AUX-biased divider.\nExternal Schottky clamps + series resistors are provisions, NOT proven powered-off isolation.\nOFF-state injection / clamp Vf / residual rail bleed / reference calibration are POWER-UP BLOCKERS." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "6f3871c1-5718-510a-87ed-9b435ed9cf43"))
